LocalizedProperties.ReleaseNotes:
Starsand Island Update - Version 1.09.4

Hi islander
[Fixes]
• Fixed an issue where the black screen after going to sleep lasted too long, and where the host and guests would wake up at different times in multiplayer mode;
• Fixed an issue where guests could incorrectly see rain or snow effects inside buildings during rainy or snowy weather in multiplayer mode;
• Fixed an issue where some NPC Affinity story quests could disappear unexpectedly;
• Fixed an issue in some save files where follow-up progression quests would disappear after completing the Become a Junior Angler! quest, preventing further progression;
• Fixed an issue in some save files where Azra's Affinity could be unexpectedly reset;
• Fixed an issue in some save files where Garrick did not appear in the resident list on the map, preventing players from locating him;

To all Islanders:
Thanks for your continued support! We're committed to making Starsand Island the best it can be, and we'll keep improving it.
Found a quirky bug? Have some ideas? Join our official Discord and talk directly with the devs! We've got our stools ready and waiting for you!

For more information, please visit our official website:
https://www.starsandisland.com/en/#/

